[0.012, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.133, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J Back Alley, noon\u001b[1;80HGoals: 1  Score: 0\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(0\u001b[0mqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqq\u001b(B\u001b[7;1H\u001b(0\u001b[0m"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(BCan you hear me? >> "]
[2.353, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1my\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ms\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.108, "o", "\r\u001b[9dGood, you're conscious. We're conscious. I've heard urban legends about synthesis going wrong, one\r\u001b[10dhalf person getting lost.\r\u001b[12d"]
[0.000, "o", "Do you remember our name?\r\u001b[14d>"]
[2.383, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.102, "o", "\r\u001b[15dTo review, we're Alexandra now. I was Alex, before the synthesis. You were...\r\u001b[17d>"]
[2.412, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mA\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1md\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ma\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.101, "o", "\r\u001b[18d...yes! Okay. We're both here, neither of us lost our minds in the synthesis process. As far as I\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "can tell, the operation was a success. We're meant to be one person now, unrecognizable to anyone\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "who knew us before.\r\u001b[22d"]
[2.414, "o", "\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[3M\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mCounterfeit Monkey\r\u001b[20d\u001b(B\u001b[mA Removal by Emily Short\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "Release 11 / Serial number 230220 / Inform 7 build 6M62 (I6/v6.41 lib 6/12N)\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "Let's try to get a look around. I haven't been able to run our body without your help, but maybe now\u001b[25;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "you're awake, it'll work better.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "To get a look around, type LOOK and press return. If you do not want help getting started, type\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "TUTORIAL OFF.\r\u001b[29d"]
[0.000, "o", ">"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mk\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.120, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[5M\u001b[25dThat's not a verb I recognize.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "To get a look around, type LOOK and press return. If you do not want help getting started, type\r\u001b[28dTUTORIAL OFF.\r\u001b[29d"]
[0.000, "o", ">"]
[2.383, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mx\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m \u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m-\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mm\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mv\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.111, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[12M\u001b[18dIt is a blunt-nosed plastic device, about the size of a laser pointer, that can be waved at things\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "to remove excess Rs. It is not very powerful, and often fails against large items. On the other\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "hand, it has a wide range of action: it can be set to any letter we choose.\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "These are, if not exactly cheap, hardly unknown in Atlantis.\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "You have a fleeting thought of how we got here.\r\u001b[26d[MEMORIES will list your currently active memories]\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "To get a look around, type LOOK and press return. If you do not want help getting started, type\r\u001b[28dTUTORIAL OFF.\r\u001b[29d"]
[0.000, "o", ">"]
[2.382, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mt\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mh\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.110, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[14M\u001b[H "]
[0.000, "o", "Sigil Street, noon\r\u001b[17d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mSigil Street\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mThe buildings here are two and three stories, with shops at ground level and elderly apartments\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "above. The shops are closed for the holiday: a typographer's office, tourist boutiques of colorful\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "skirts and ethnic bodices (rarely if ever worn by natives) and t-shirts covered with font designs.\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "Passing by the reflective window we catch the sight of our single blended body, and it creeps me\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "out.\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "A narrow alley runs between buildings to the south, while the street continues east.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "There are other things around here that you can look at too, if you like. You can check out other\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "things in your surroundings, or LOOK AT ME to see yourself.\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.383, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ma\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ms\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mt\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.130, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[13M\u001b[H "]
[0.000, "o", "Ampersand Bend, noon\r\u001b[18d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mAmpersand Bend\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mA bend in the street, which runs west and north. This district combines the old and the new: a small\u001b[20;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "museum in an ancient stone building to the east, a shiny real estate office south. The window of the\u001b[21;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "museum is currently displaying one of its exhibits, a codex.\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "A temporary barrier blocks this empty street from the busy fair to the north, though there is a door\u001b[24;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "that could be opened with the correct code. From here the gaiety and excitement of the holiday are\r\u001b[25dfairly loud.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "There are other things around here that you can look at too, if you like. You can check out other\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "things in your surroundings, or LOOK AT ME to see yourself.\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.383, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mq\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mu\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mi\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mt\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.101, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[M\u001b[29dAre you sure you want to quit? "]
[0.995, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1my\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.092, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[M\u001b[30d \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mHit any key to exit.\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
